Testing universal length function (dherer):
Basic examples:
  dherer([1, 2, 3]): 3
  dherer('Soplang'): 7
  dherer(object o): 1

More list examples:
  Empty list length: 0
  Nested list length: 3
  Mixed list length: 4

More string examples:
  Empty string length: 0
  String with spaces length: 11
  String with special chars length: 9

More object examples:
  Empty object length: 0
  Object with multiple properties: 3
  Nested object length: 2

Practical applications:
  Sum of numbers using loop and dherer(): 150
  Truncated string: Soplang waa luqad cu...
  Config has 3 settings

Error handling test:
  Note: The following line would cause an error if uncommented:
  // dherer(123) - Would throw error as numbers are not supported

Universal length function tests completed!
